Job description:
You will be tasked with creating and developing a program or application as an IT solution through a certain programming language, and ensuring the quality of the developed application to meet the standard requirements that have been set. Apart from that, you will also be in charge of planning test plans and test cases, testing bugs in applications, evaluating findings and taking appropriate corrective actions. You also have the opportunity to learn to keep up with the very fast developments in the IT world.




Requirements :

S1 Fresh graduate from reputable university with minimum GPA 2.75;

At least minimum 1 year experience;

Have good algorithm, analytic, and systematic skills, able to complete tasks in tight deadline;

Have knowledge in PL/SQL;

Able to develope Mobile Application ( IOS / Android );

Passionate in program development and coding.
